{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: You must have received a dragon blessing or enhacement from an Young or older Dragon (The dragon must also be a True Dragon, either Chromatic, Gem, Metallic or other) either by favor, the energy released upon it\u0027s death or bathing or drinking portions of it\u0027s blood.\n\nYou gain the aid of a draconic familiar, which might be a splinter of the consciousness of a dragon that invested you with power. You gain the following:\n\nDraconic Follower: You can cast the Find Familiar spell as a a bonus action using solely somatic components. When you cast the spell in this way, your familiar always takes the form of a pseudodragon. You can\u0027t do so again until you finish a long rest.\n\nMerged Being: As an action, your familiar can magically merge with you, hiding within your being as a strange scar, tatoo or any other notable physical feature. While merged in this way, it can\u0027t take any actions except one as a free action to separate from you, but you share it\u0027s senses and it\u0027s Magical Resistance trait as if it were within 10 feet of you. It can\u0027t receive any damage or subjected to any condition while merged in this way.\n\nEnhanced Familiar: In addition to the standard rules for the spell, your familiar has extra maximum hit points equal to twice your level and it can take any action, not just the ones specified by the spell. It also uses your proficiency bonus instead of his own for any skill or saving throw it would make.","level":1}],"id":"Custom62e896b2-ed7e-4c5b-be67-8533fc2f4f91","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Draconic Gift of Companionship [FTD] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}